From: bplhkx <bplhkx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 23:29:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat: add independent AOSP gesture restoration switch

Add a master switch for AOSP predictive-back restoration so optional features such as Google Circle to Search can be enabled on their own. Gate SystemUI back-input install, HyperOS extras, and system_server app opt-in on the new preference.

Circle to Search and its Live Translate / Lens / haptic sub-options remain independently controllable and do not require the AOSP restoration switch.
