Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 23:55:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix: keep Circle to Search trigger haptic independent of
 AOSP switch

Always register the SystemUI status receiver used for MODULE_CONTEXTUAL_SEARCH_TRIGGERED even when AOSP predictive-back restoration is disabled. Fail open the AOSP preference to its default enabled value on read errors. Play the CTS haptic after a successful Android 16 SystemUI long-press invoke.
